{"title":"Career Roadmap: Information Designer","role":"Information Designer","summary":"Career Domain: Media, Communication, Arts & Design · Qualification Pathway: B.Des – Data Visualisation / Information Design · Target Career: Information Designer","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Data Visualisation / Information Design"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Information Designer turns data and complex information into clear charts, maps, infographics, dashboards and explainers that people can understand at a glance."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Information Designer does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand the data and the story it tells"},{"text":"Design charts, infographics and dashboards"},{"text":"Build interactive visualisations"},{"text":"Test with users and improve clarity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newsrooms and data journalism teams"},{"text":"Consulting and research firms"},{"text":"Tech and product companies"},{"text":"Government and NGO data teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Junior Designer"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Information Designer"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Senior Designer"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Lead / Visual Journalism Editor"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Design Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Design and numbers"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography, layout and colour"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Learn Illustrator"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learn chart principles and accessibility"},{"text":"Learn Tableau or Flourish"},{"text":"Redesign 10 confusing charts you find"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Interactive work"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learn basic code (HTML, D3.js or Observable)"},{"text":"Intern with a newsroom or data team"},{"text":"Make an interactive data story"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Final project with real public data"},{"text":"Publish case studies"},{"text":"Apply to newsrooms, consultancies and product teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Information hierarchy"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Basic coding"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Clarity of thought"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Curiosity"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Working with analysts"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Tableau / Power BI"},{"text":"Flourish / Datawrapper"},{"text":"D3.js"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newsrooms"},{"text":"Research and consulting firms"},{"text":"Product design teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tableau certification"},{"text":"Data-visualisation courses"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p",